OL,3,GNEWSACelebrity Hunted showed I can
OL,4,Aachieve anything after cancer, Amy
OL,5,ADowden says
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpoiler warning: This story contains
OL,8,Fdetails of the winner(s) of Celebrity
OL,9,FHunted
OL,11,FStrictly Come Dancing star Amy Dowden
OL,12,Fhas said winning Celebrity Hunted has
OL,13,Fhelped her believe she can "achieve
OL,14,Fanything" following her battle with
OL,15,Fcancer.
OL,17,FThe 36-year-old professional dancer won
OL,18,Fthe latest series of the Channel 4
OL,19,Fchallenge show alongside Strictly's
OL,20,FCarlos Gu, claiming a joint victory
OL,21,Fwith actor Brian Conley and his
OL,22,Fdaughter, comedian Lucy Conley.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
